/-!
# Bounded eight-bit stabilizer certificates

There are 64 transversals along the ordered base 3, 5, 9, 128, 1, 16, 32, 64.
The permitted images, determined by the invariant sixteen and involution color,
have sizes 15, 14, 12, 8, 8, 4, 2, 1. Each transversal is checked on eight basis
vectors and every finite check is evaluated by the Lean kernel. Literal arrays
and explicit list checks bound elaboration and normalization cost.
Source: Kleidman--Wilson (1988), Section 2.1, elementary-eight normalizers.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Janko4.LocalStructure.ElementaryNormalizerCover.PureTwoA.EightAutomizer

